摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Arbitrary file upload, reading, OCR, and rendering for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1337293702","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-open-file","slug":"hyper-dsh-plugins/dsh-open-file","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Arbitrary file upload, reading, OCR, and rendering for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-open-file"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Workspace-scoped file attachments, document reading, local OCR, and page rendering for DeepSeek Harn"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e-scoped file attachments, document reading, local OCR, and page rendering for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-open-file` brings files of any format into DeepSeek Harness conversations. Its included agent t"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ools inspect each upload and read, OCR, or render the content available for the task through one tra"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"h upload and read, OCR, or render the content available for the task through one traceable workflow."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Drag files into the conversation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Drop one or more files anywhere in DeepSeek Harness Web to add them to the active session."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Adds an **Add → Attachment** action to the existing `+` menu.\n- Accepts multiple files through the"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" system picker, page-wide drag and drop, and clipboard paste.\n- Presents compact draft cards with fo"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"rmat icons, upload progress, cancellation, retry, and removal controls.\n- Places sent attachment car"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ds directly below their user message and keeps the conversation aligned.\n- Streams same-origin binar"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"y uploads into the active session workspace.\n- Provides four agent tools: `file_inspect`, `file_read"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"`, `file_ocr`, and `file_render`.\n- Reads text, PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, bounded ZIP archives, common "},{"id":"p9s7","text":"image formats, and metadata for regular files.\n- Runs English and Simplified Chinese OCR with packag"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"ed language data.\n- Returns source hashes, locators, cursors, parsers, and stable references for tra"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"\n- Returns source hashes, locators, cursors, parsers, and stable references for traceable reasoning."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Component | Version or requirement |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness | `0.1.0-rc.6` |\n| Node.js | `>=22.13.0` |\n| Operating systems | Windows, Linux, "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"macOS |\n| Browser APIs | `fetch`, `XMLHttpRequest`, `File`, drag and drop, clipboard file paste |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The Web integration uses the rc.6 input-trigger registration, conversation renderer, native image wo"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rkflow, and client runtime APIs. Compatibility checks report `FILE_WEB_COMPATIBILITY` when the host "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"contract requires attention."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"For DeepSeek Harness `0.1.2-rc.1`: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-open-file@0.1.2-rc.1`.\nInstall "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"the latest npm release:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install version `0.1.2`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Install a locally reviewed package:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The package activates the Host service, Web client, and Open File Skill through `cordis.patch.yml`. "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"npm presents this `README.md` as the package documentation."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. Open a DeepSeek Harness session with an active workspace.\n2. Select `+` → **Add** → **Attachment*"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"*, drop files onto the Web app, or paste files from the clipboard.\n3. Review the draft cards and wai"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"t for the ready state.\n4. Send the message to create session-bound `dsh-open-file://attachment/v1/.."},{"id":"p23s4","text":".` references.\n5. Let the Assistant inspect, read, OCR, or render the selected content."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Upload any file format whenever your task calls for it"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Documents, data, source code, archives, images, and every other format share one attachment flow."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Tool | Role |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `file_inspect` | Returns metadata, parser details, and selectable `part_ref` values |\n| `file_read"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"` | Reads a selected part with text cursors or worksheet ranges |\n| `file_ocr` | Runs local English "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"and Simplified Chinese OCR on a selected image part |\n| `file_render` | Renders a selected document "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"part to a workspace PNG |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Image files integrate with the DSH image workflow. Documents and regular files use the workspace att"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"rate with the DSH image workflow. Documents and regular files use the workspace attachment workflow."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Version `0.1.2` uses packaged release defaults. `cordis.patch.yml` registers the Host service, Web c"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"lient, and Skill. Resource limits are listed below and represented in the public contract."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Permissions, storage, and protocol"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Source files and derived artifacts live under the active session workspace:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The plugin reads and writes this session directory and registers same-origin upload routes on the DS"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"H Web Host. OCR uses the packaged `eng` and `chi_sim` language data."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Tool responses include the source hash, parser, locator, cursor, and canonical references. Extracted"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" file content is tagged as untrusted evidence for downstream reasoning."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Default limits"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| Limit | Default |\n| --- | ---: |\n| File size | 256 MiB |\n| Draft files per session | 20 |\n| Draft "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"bytes per session | 512 MiB |\n| ZIP entries | 10,000 |\n| Expanded ZIP entry | 64 MiB |\n| Total expan"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ded ZIP bytes | 512 MiB |\n| ZIP compression ratio | 100:1 |\n| Upload timeout | 300 seconds |\n| Parse"},{"id":"p38s4","text":" and render timeout | 30 seconds |\n| OCR timeout | 120 seconds |\n| Rendered pixels | 40,000,000 |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"These values define the `0.1.2` resource envelope."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"- Session references, active Agent sessions, authoritative workspaces, and disk metadata participate"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" in one validation chain.\n- Canonical containment and symlink-aware checks protect managed workspace"},{"id":"p41s3","text":" paths.\n- ZIP validation covers normalized paths, links, encryption, duplicates, CRC integrity, arch"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"ive depth, expansion size, and compression ratio.\n- Office XML validation covers declarations, entit"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"ies, and relationship targets.\n- Type detection uses magic bytes and container structure.\n- Publishe"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"d sources are immutable; derived artifacts use exclusive creation and atomic metadata replacement."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"See SECURITY.md for the security policy and reporting process."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"- **Attachment entry:** confirm that the Web client plugin is active and the Host matches DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"arness `0.1.0-rc.6`.\n- **Upload:** confirm the live session, workspace permissions, same-origin rout"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"e, and resource limits.\n- **OCR:** select an image part or a PNG generated by `file_render`, then ch"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"oose `eng`, `chi_sim`, or both languages.\n- **Document parsing:** use `file_inspect` to review the d"},{"id":"p44s5","text":"etected type, parser, and available parts."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"Stable error codes are exported from the package contract and included in tool failures for programm"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"odes are exported from the package contract and included in tool failures for programmatic handling."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Install a selected release to complete a version change:"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
